
@loanId = LOAN_ID

### Registrar vecino1 (presta) — solo la primera vez
POST localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana",
  "paternalSurname": "Lopez",
  "maternalSurname": "Ruiz",
  "email": "vecino1@test.com",
  "phoneNumber": "+525500000001",
  "username": "vecino1",
  "password": "Vecino123@"
}

### Registrar vecino2 (pide prestado) — solo la primera vez
POST localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Luis",
  "paternalSurname": "Garcia",
  "maternalSurname": "Diaz",
  "email": "vecino2@test.com",
  "phoneNumber": "+525500000002",
  "username": "vecino2",
  "password": "Vecino123@"
}

### Registrar vecino3 (ajeno al préstamo) — solo la primera vez
POST localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sara",
  "paternalSurname": "Mora",
  "maternalSurname": "Vega",
  "email": "vecino3@test.com",
  "phoneNumber": "+525500000003",
  "username": "vecino3",
  "password": "Vecino123@"
}

### Login vecino1
POST localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "vecino1",
  "password": "Vecino123@"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("v1_token", response.body.token);
%}

### Login vecino2
POST localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "vecino2",
  "password": "Vecino123@"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("v2_token", response.body.token);
%}

### Login vecino3
POST localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "vecino3",
  "password": "Vecino123@"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("v3_token", response.body.token);
%}

### Login superadmin
POST localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "superadmin",
  "password": "Admin@1234"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("super_token", response.body.token);
%}

### vecino1 reporta a vecino2 -> 201
POST localhost:3000/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{v1_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loanId": "{{loanId}}",
  "text": "No devolvió el taladro",
  "image": "https://example.com/evidencia.jpg"
}

### Texto vacío -> 400
POST localhost:3000/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{v1_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loanId": "{{loanId}}",
  "text": "   "
}

### Préstamo inexistente -> 404
POST localhost:3000/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{v1_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loanId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "text": "No existe"
}

### vecino3 reporta un préstamo ajeno -> 403
POST localhost:3000/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{v3_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loanId": "{{loanId}}",
  "text": "Me meto donde no"
}

### vecino2 ve el reporte sobre él -> [ { text, resolved: false } ]
GET localhost:3000/reports/me
Authorization: Bearer {{v2_token}}

### vecino1 es el autor -> []
GET localhost:3000/reports/me
Authorization: Bearer {{v1_token}}

### vecino3 no participó -> []
GET localhost:3000/reports/me
Authorization: Bearer {{v3_token}}

### superadmin no ve reportes de vecinos -> []
GET localhost:3000/reports/me
Authorization: Bearer {{super_token}}
